           dcterms:identifier "https://doi.org/10.3406/befeo.2010.6130"^^xsd:anyURI ;
           dcterms:title "The Archaeological Landscape of Koh Ker, Northwest Cambodia" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/2026/khmerLOD/PUB_00055
